<<if GetIsCompanionInParty($kieran) == false>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Old takeout boxes and receipts fill the bin.][/nomarkup] #line:08449de
    -> [nomarkup][Walk away.][/nomarkup]
<<else>>
    <<CompleteObjective "Q_0P_MAIN_SATURDAY_START" "FIGURE_OUT_WHERE_YOU_WERE">>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Sifting through your trash, you find a bar tab receipt for The Embassy, a nightclub on the Las Vegas Strip. By the looks of it, you racked up quite the tab.][/nomarkup] #line:04fc883
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Kieran's eyebrows arch at the sight. An agitated frown. A crack in his composed mask.][/nomarkup] 
    {$kieran}: Is that…? 
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He grabs the receipt out of your hands and inspects it thoroughly.][/nomarkup]
    {$kieran}: Curious.  
    {$kieran}: This city is getting too small for my liking. It seems, you were at The Embassy last night. That is the domain of my own Sire, which for you I would not take as good news. She is… 
    {$kieran}: A character.
    <<if $coveredinblood == true>>
        {$kieran}: Pardon me, but please clean yourself up before we depart, or we will not be allowed within sight of the place. I would recommend a quick shower, but... #line:083e315
    <<endif>>
    {$kieran}: Regardless, we should head there promptly. She may have the answers we are looking for. 
    -> [nomarkup][Walk away.][/nomarkup]
<<endif>>
